{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14785","headline":"赋得彭祖楼送杨德宗归徐州幕 · 卢纶","name":"赋得彭祖楼送杨德宗归徐州幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四户八窗明，玲珑逼上清。\n外栏黄鹄下，中柱紫芝生。\n每带云霞色，时闻箫管声。\n望君兼有月，幢盖俨层城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}